## Game content

This project reads Dungeons & Dragons rules data from the 5etools project
(https://github.com/5etools-mirror-3/5etools-src) at runtime. That data is
fetched to `vendor/5etools/`, which is gitignored and never committed or
redistributed here.

Dungeons & Dragons rules content is the copyright of Wizards of the Coast LLC.
This project is unaffiliated with and unendorsed by Wizards of the Coast. It is
a personal tool for local use only, and is not intended for public hosting or
redistribution of game content.

To use this project you must fetch the data yourself with `pnpm content:sync`.
